# Trivy suppressions — each entry needs a justification.

# DS-0002 "no non-root USER": Dockerfile.test images exist to run fedora-harden.sh,
# which must run as root, and the "base" image boots systemd as PID 1. The images are
# test-only, run rootless under podman, and are never published or deployed.
DS-0002

